  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span><span><span>材質包提供兩種美觀選項：標準版和連接版。</span></span></span></strong></span></em></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>材質美化來源參考：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cozyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">CozyUI+</span></a>。請搭配對應的材質包使用。<br></span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>版本：<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">NeoForge 1.21.x<span style=\"color:#fff\">，</span></span>其他版本請自行測試並告知結果。<br></span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>本材質包遵循 GPL-3.0 許可證。如需源文件，請聯繫我。</span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span><span><span>模組：<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><a style=\"color:#fbeeb8\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a></span></span></span></span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span><span><span>建議搭配使用的資源包：<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cozyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI+</a></span></span></span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span><span><span>本材質包基於：<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://github.com/Fogg05/CozyUI-Plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI-plus</a></span></span></span></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
